1
00:00:02,197 --> 00:00:03,197
Eunwoo

2
00:00:04,582 --> 00:00:06,582
you worked so hard today.

3
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:23,021
You know... I used to have a
one-sided crush for a long time.

4
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:31,149
I'd always think, “Maybe someday
they'll look at me.”

5
00:00:32,396 --> 00:00:33,940
So I kept waiting,

6
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,592
kept giving way,
and that's all it ever was.

7
00:00:41,116 --> 00:00:43,012
But the truth is,

8
00:00:44,259 --> 00:00:46,528
if you just sit there quietly,
that day never comes.

9
00:00:53,007 --> 00:00:54,007
Unnie.

10
00:00:54,501 --> 00:00:55,501
Hmm?

11
00:00:57,682 --> 00:00:59,682
I hate seeing you

12
00:01:00,331 --> 00:01:02,124
hurting like this.

13
00:01:04,791 --> 00:01:06,791
That's why I want to stay by your side,

14
00:01:07,271 --> 00:01:08,960
so you don't have to go through it alone.

15
00:01:09,883 --> 00:01:11,199
You're solid.

16
00:01:12,576 --> 00:01:13,576
Thank you.

17
00:01:18,001 --> 00:01:19,504
Unnie…

18
00:01:28,374 --> 00:01:29,856
I like you.

19
00:01:31,347 --> 00:01:33,409
I like you too, Eunwoo.

20
00:01:35,328 --> 00:01:36,354
No...

21
00:01:38,542 --> 00:01:40,542
I really like you.

22
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:57,500
But

23
00:01:57,817 --> 00:01:58,946
from now on,

24
00:02:00,001 --> 00:02:01,669
I'll just like you...

25
00:02:01,669 --> 00:02:03,535
as a coworker.

26
00:02:11,782 --> 00:02:12,849
I just needed to say it.

27
00:02:13,903 --> 00:02:15,447
That's all.

28
00:02:18,495 --> 00:02:21,055
But seriously, unnie...

29
00:02:21,995 --> 00:02:23,995
How could you not notice until now?

30
00:02:35,161 --> 00:02:36,415
Nothing's gonna change.

31
00:02:38,613 --> 00:02:40,281
So don't get awkward.

32
00:02:42,836 --> 00:02:44,334
Especially not in front of Yubin.

33
00:02:48,961 --> 00:02:51,023
Yeah... it shows.

34
00:02:58,909 --> 00:03:00,349
Let's go wrap this up.

35
00:03:23,786 --> 00:03:25,167
What's this?

36
00:03:26,106 --> 00:03:27,380
The fabric we needed.

37
00:03:30,107 --> 00:03:31,299
Why's it here?

38
00:03:33,476 --> 00:03:34,937
They said it was out of stock.

39
00:03:35,230 --> 00:03:36,230
Where did you get it?

40
00:03:37,725 --> 00:03:40,057
I called around to the companies
that had already bought it.

41
00:03:40,057 --> 00:03:41,860
Found leftover stock and picked it up.

42
00:03:42,529 --> 00:03:43,679
And payment?

43
00:03:44,548 --> 00:03:47,812
The supplier helped us out.
Gave it to us on credit.

44
00:03:50,153 --> 00:03:51,365
Thank god.
